<ServiceLayout title="Wellness Care" description="Ongoing wellness chiropractic care at Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH to keep your body functioning at its best.">

<p>
  Wellness care is about more than treating pain — it's about maintaining the health you've achieved and preventing future problems. Just as regular dental check-ups prevent cavities, regular chiropractic care keeps your spine aligned and your nervous system functioning optimally.
</p>

<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />

<h2>Why wellness care matters</h2>
<p>
  Daily life puts stress on your spine — sitting at a desk, lifting, driving, even sleeping in an awkward position. Over time, these small stresses accumulate into subluxations that can affect your health before you even feel symptoms. Regular wellness visits catch and correct these misalignments early.
</p>

<h2>What wellness visits look like</h2>
<p>
  Wellness visits are typically shorter than initial treatment visits. Your chiropractor will check your spine for any areas of concern, make gentle adjustments as needed, and discuss any changes in your health or lifestyle. Most wellness patients visit on a schedule that works for their body — whether that's weekly, biweekly, or monthly.
</p>

</ServiceLayout>
